The system must preserve:
\begin{itemize}
    \item membrane boundaries,
    \item tissue connectivity,
    \item organ-level geometry.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Functional Continuity}
The system must maintain:
\begin{itemize}
    \item metabolic viability,
    \item signaling fidelity,
    \item resource allocation stability.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Identity Continuity}
The system must retain:
\begin{itemize}
    \item autopoietic self-recognition,
    \item boundary maintenance,
    \item recovery potential.
\end{itemize}

These invariants are enforced through continuity-driven damping and UFSL
